<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>보증서 발송 | ARK PROJECT</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root { --green:#1A3620; --gold:#D4AF37; --gold-soft:#E8D9A0; --paper:#FBF8F0; --line:rgba(212,175,55,0.22); }
    * { box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }
    body { font-family:'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#1A3620,#0E1F12); color:var(--paper); min-height:100vh; padding:26px 14px 60px; }
    .wrap { max-width:560px; margin:0 auto; }
    .top { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:18px; }
    .logo { font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; color:var(--gold); letter-spacing:3px; font-size:15px; }
    .nav a, .logout { color:var(--gold-soft); font-size:12px; text-decoration:none; border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.4); padding:6px 12px; border-radius:6px; background:none; cursor:pointer; margin-left:6px; font-family:inherit; }
    .nav a.active { background:var(--gold); color:#10220f; border-color:var(--gold); }
    .panel { background:rgba(0,0,0,0.22); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; padding:24px 22px; }
    label { display:block; font-size:13px; color:var(--gold-soft); margin:16px 0 7px; }
    label:first-child { margin-top:0; }
    input[type=text], input[type=tel] { width:100%; padding:13px 12px; border-radius:7px; font-size:15px; border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.30); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); color:#fff; font-family:inherit; }
    input:focus { outline:none; border-color:var(--gold); }
    .hint { font-size:11px; color:var(--gold-soft); opacity:0.6; margin-top:5px; }
    button.submit { width:100%; margin-top:22px; padding:15px; border:none; border-radius:9px; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E6C75A,#D4AF37); color:#10220f; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1px; cursor:pointer; font-family:inherit; }
    .alert { margin-bottom:16px; padding:14px 16px; border-radius:10px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; }
    .alert.error { background:rgba(180,50,50,0.18); border:1px solid rgba(220,100,100,0.5); color:#ffd9d9; }
    .alert.ok { background:rgba(212,175,55,0.12); border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.5); color:var(--gold-soft); }
    .alert.ok a { color:var(--gold); word-break:break-all; }
    .desc { font-size:13px; line-height:1.7; color:var(--gold-soft); opacity:0.85; margin-bottom:18px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="top">
      <div class="logo">ARK PROJECT · BY JIYANG</div>
      <div class="nav">
        <a href="/admin/new">개체 등록</a>
        <a href="/admin" class="active">보증서 발송</a>
        <form method="post" action="/admin/logout" style="display:inline;"><button class="logout" type="submit">로그아웃</button></form>
      </div>
    </div>

    <% if (error) { %>
    <div class="alert error">⚠️ <%= error %></div>
    <% } %>
    <% if (result) { %>
    <div class="alert ok">
      ✅ <b><%= result.variety %></b> (<%= result.id %>) 보증서를 <b><%= result.phone %></b> 번호로 <b><%= result.channel %></b> 발송했습니다.<br/>
      보증서 링크: <a href="<%= result.url %>" target="_blank"><%= result.url %></a>
    </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="panel">
      <div class="desc">
        제품(고유)번호와 고객 휴대폰 번호를 입력하면,<br/>
        디지털 보증서 링크가 알림톡(또는 문자)으로 자동 발송됩니다.
      </div>
      <form method="post" action="/admin/send">
        <label>제품(고유)번호</label>
        <input type="text" name="id" value="<%= form.id || '' %>" placeholder="예: HW-2026-0001" />
        <div class="hint">구글 시트의 '고유번호'와 정확히 같아야 합니다.</div>

        <label>고객 이름 (선택)</label>
        <input type="text" name="name" value="<%= form.name || '' %>" placeholder="예: 홍길동 — 입력 시 시트의 소유자에도 기록됩니다" />

        <label>고객 휴대폰 번호</label>
        <input type="tel" name="phone" value="<%= form.phone || '' %>" placeholder="예: 01012345678" />

        <button class="submit" type="submit">보증서 발송하기</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
